ry adipose tissue is sectioned to reveal tan pink  soft and grossly unremarkable lymph nodes  measuring up to 1cm in diameter  A firm 0 5cm poorly defined  gray  white area is present in the tail of the axilla  Section Code A D   blood filled cystic cavity E   deep resection margin closest to cavity F G   unremarkable breast H   skin scar I   separate indurated area J   nipple K L   axillary lymph nodes M   nodule in axillary tail P CC   additional sections from the breast Also received in the same container is a specimen consisting of a 10 x 9 5cm skin ellipse excised to a depth of 2cm  containing a recent 6cm incision with 7 staples closing the incision  No diagnostic abnormality is recognized  A representative section of the incision submitted in N and unremarkable adipose tissue in O  Resident  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST AND AXILLA   report_end  , Unchecked.
