ng and one short suture   superficial  two short sutures   superior  two long sutures   medial  The specimen is inked entirely in black and the medial margin is over inked in blue and the lateral margin is over inked in red  The specimen is sectioned from deep to superficially to reveal a firm tan white  ill defined area with a central area of hemorrhage which measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 3cm and grossly extends to the medial margin  The section of tumor with the closest margin is submitted in cassette K  Three other representative sections of tumor in relationship to margins are submitted in L through N and two sections of grossly uninvolved tissue are submitted in O and P  Labeled  Final deep margin  right breast  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm fragment of breast with attached suture designated by the surgeon as  final deep margin   The deep margin is inked black and the specimen is sectioned to reveal a firm tan pink  ill defined area which measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm in overall dimensions and grossly abuts the superficial aspect of the specimen  inked blue   the entire lesion is submitted in cassettes Q  R  and S  The remainder of the specimen is submitted entirely in T through W  Resident  LISA A  GALLAGHER  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART A  BREAST  RIGHT    RE EXCISION PART B  BREAST  SUPERIOR MARGIN   RE EXCISION PART C  BREAST  RIGHT DEEP MARGIN    EXCISION   report_end  , Unchecked.
